{"id":"schritt","lemma":"Schritt","pos":"noun","rank":923,"glosses":["step, footstep (a single instance of walking)","walk (slow gait of a horse)","crotch (the area between the human legs close to the genitals or comprising them)"],"ipa":"/ʃʁɪt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/De-Schritt.ogg/De-Schritt.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schrittes","plural":"Schritte"},"formAudio":{"Schritte":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Schritte.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich höre Schritte.","en":"I can hear footsteps.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},null]},{"text":"Wer schritt ein?","en":"Who intervened?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/106289","words":[{"g":"who"},null,{"g":"a"}]},{"text":"Ich habe den ersten Schritt getan.","en":"I made the first move.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700170","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"first","l":"erste"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"tun"}]},{"text":"Er ging schnellen Schrittes.","en":"He walked at a quick pace.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761819","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"quickly","l":"schnell"},null]},{"text":"Kannst du mit mir Schritt halten?","en":"Can you keep up with me?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"to hold"}]}]}